        "id": 94249,
        "name": "Christopher",
        "username": "Christopher",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/christopher/{size}/1851_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-03-05T18:54:02.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I wouldn't say they're one-dimensional. I'd say they feel like tropes you might be familiar, but then there are things which happen that break them out of those tropes.</p><p>Then again, I'd (narcissistically) say the same things about some of my favorite superheroes from a certain card game. So, I have my bias.</p>",
